---
import Heading from '@/components/ui/Heading.astro';
import Section from '@/components/ui/Section.astro';
---

<Section>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-start gap-12 md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-16">
        <Heading size="display">Our vision</Heading>
        <div class="flex flex-col gap-6">
            <p class="text-body m-0">
                Pelican Productions envisions a vibrant future where young
                people in South Australia thrive through the transformative
                power of live theatre. Founded in 2004 by Directors Jen Frith
                and Kylie Green, we create innovative and entertaining
                theatrical experiences that inspire, educate and elevate young
                performers.
            </p>
            <p class="text-body m-0">
                We aim to be a beacon of creativity and excellence in youth
                theatre — professional training and invaluable performance
                opportunities that equip performers with skills in singing,
                dancing and acting, and with teamwork, respect, confidence,
                empathy and resilience.
            </p>
            <p class="text-body m-0">
                Our teaching artists and creative teams are industry
                professionals who foster a supportive, inclusive environment. We
                strive to instil a love for the performing arts and a sense of
                belonging in every participant, regardless of race, ethnicity,
                gender, socio-economic status, national origin, sexual
                orientation, ability or faith.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</Section>
